:reading_date rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
              rdfs:domain :Measurement ;
              rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .


###  http://www.example.com/semanticMeasurements#removal_indication
:removal_indication rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                    rdfs:domain :Meter ;
                    rdfs:range xsd:string .


